{"title":"향기로운 꽃은 늠름하게 핀다 [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=oT8E3/dJMcahzfzCV/4qXkOKVS8iUh05NkiHxKMK&filename=th3","synopsis":"어떤 곳에, 인접해있는 두 고등학교가 있다.\n바보들만 모이는 양아치 남학교 치도리 고교와\n유서 깊은 부잣집 아가씨 학교 키쿄 여고.\n\n험상궃고 조용한 치도리 고교 2학년 츠무기 린타로는\n본가에서 하는 케이크 가게 일을 돕다가\n손님으로 온 소녀 와구리 카오루코를 만난다.\n\n린타로는 카오루코와 함께 있는 시간이 편안하게 느껴졌는데,\n그녀는 철저하게 치도리를 싫어하는 키쿄 여고의 학생이었다...?!\n\n'가깝고도 먼' 두 사람이 자아내는, 청춘으로 물든 학교 이야기!!\n\n[The Fragrant Flower Blooms with Dignity]\nⓒSaka Mikami 2022\nAll rights reserved.\nFirst published in Japan in 2022 by Kodansha Ltd.\nKorean translation rights arranged by Kodansha Ltd.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":196,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":286,"change":{"type":"down","amount":90}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":185,"change":{"type":"up","amount":101}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":279,"change":{"type":"down","amount":94}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":198,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":173,"change":{"type":"up","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":192,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":192,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":280,"change":{"type":"down","amount":88}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":300,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":183,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":163,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":234,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":177,"change":{"type":"up","amount":57}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":250,"change":{"type":"down","amount":73}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":300,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-20","rank":256,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-22","rank":272,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-23","rank":198,"change":{"type":"up","amount":74}},